WEBVTT

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:24.870
Saint Seiya

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:33.590
The Underworld.

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:38.270
The land of the dead ruled by Hades.

00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:44.730
The battle of the young
warriors of hope escalates.

00:01:45.010 --> 00:01:48.820
They are at the mercy of destiny.

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:51.830
Athena!

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:05.230
Athena, Miss Saori's Cosmo has vanished.
I can't do anything anymore.

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:10.640
To save Miss Saori... To
bring peace to the world.

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:16.950
To reunite with my sister.

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:21.080
Seiya.

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:26.620
Seiya. What are you doing?

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.530
Marin.

00:02:28.990 --> 00:02:31.090
Have you forgotten, Seiya?

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:34.990
Even if there is a one percent
chance, you don't give up.

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:37.140
That's the way of the Saints of hope.

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:39.960
Saints of hope.

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:44.230
Yes. Never give up. Never throw hope away.

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:46.980
You understand, Seiya?

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:56.540
Athena's Cloth.

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:00.700
It's still here.

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:04.430
There's still hope left.

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:09.010
It is us who must grab on to hope.

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:11.260
We are Athena's Saints!

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:20.930
Desperation at the Wailing Wall

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:24.450
Hades and Athena's Cosmo disappeared.

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:28.320
What exactly happened inside?

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:34.220
Could it be? Could it be
they're headed to that place?

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:38.570
If so, then there's nothing we can do.

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:45.470
A mortal cannot get past that wall.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:51.840
So my dream will never...

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:01.070
Is that Pegasus?

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:07.390
Did he escape the Ice Hell of Cocytus?

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:09.360
Miss Saori!

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:11.230
Miss Saori!

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:15.000
How did he do it?

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:17.020
Athena!

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:28.620
What's with this mess? What happened here?

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:34.170
That's Shun!

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.330
It's Shun. Shun!

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:39.450
Are you all right?

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:43.260
Seiya.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:46.980
Shun, you're back to your old self!

00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:52.340
That's right, Shun, what
about Athena? Where's Athena?

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:58.180
I don't know. I think her
Cosmo went down over there.

00:04:58.270 --> 00:04:59.770
Down where?

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:09.560
An eclipse.

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:14.670
It's been a while since Seiya and
the others went to the Underworld.

00:05:14.670 --> 00:05:17.530
Yes. I hope they're all right.

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:23.630
Don't worry. They might have
already taken the head of Hades.

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:29.870
You're right! The Gold
Saints are with them too.

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:35.800
Don't die for Miss Saori, Seiya.

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:41.490
The sun is disappearing!

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:42.770
Wow!

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:45.920
Miho, what is that?

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:51.540
It's called an eclipse. It's when
the moon moves in front of the sun.

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:55.400
It's daytime but it'll get as dark as night.

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:57.780
I see.

00:05:58.140 --> 00:06:03.960
But it's strange. I didn't hear
about an eclipse in the news.

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:07.710
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:16.760
I didn't think there'd be such

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:18.530
a long staircase in the
back of this building.

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:22.090
Beyond this must be where
Athena and Hades are.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:26.110
Seiya, look!

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:28.080
What's that?

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:33.080
It's a dead end.

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:36.040
Where did Athena and Hades go?

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:38.820
What is going on?

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:42.530
What a huge wall.

00:06:43.740 --> 00:06:45.470
What is with this wall?

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:50.050
That is the Wailing Wall,
the final realm of hell.

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:55.690
Shaka!

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:57.690
What happened?

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:02.050
Athena went chasing after Hades
and disappeared beyond that wall.

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:03.540
What did you say?

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:06.430
All right, then we'll go immediately.

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:07.130
It's no use.

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:12.490
I just told you this was the Wailing Wall.

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:16.580
Only Gods can pass through.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:18.260
No way.

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:22.130
We can break down a wall like this.

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:25.460
That's what I thought and
tried a couple times.

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:28.320
Demon Pacifier!

00:07:33.780 --> 00:07:40.380
But no matter how many times I
tried I couldn't put a crack in it.

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:46.860
The wall offers nothing but death to mortals.

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:50.250
It's not possible even with Shaka's strength?

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:57.570
No. Beyond this wall is Athena, Miss Saori.

00:08:02.930 --> 00:08:03.820
Seiya.

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:14.560
I was so close to handing
Miss Saori the Athena Cloth.

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:19.120
Seiya, stop it.

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:24.410
Shun, but we can't just sit here.

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:28.530
I need to get the Athena
Cloth to Miss Saori somehow.

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:31.290
Or else she won't be able
to completely defeat Hades.

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:35.990
No, in her condition she will be killed.

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:42.080
Shaka, what is beyond this wall?

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:46.810
If this is the end of hell,
what's beyond the wall?

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:53.960
Even I don't know what kind of world
lies on the other side of hell.

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:56.140
Could it be?

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:59.640
That what is beyond this Wailing Wall is...

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:04.870
Elysion.

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:06.870
Elysion?

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:12.100
I've heard of it from the
Specter on the Acheron River.

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:17.470
Elysion is the paradise of the Underworld.

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:25.130
If I'm correct, the true
body of Hades is in Elysion.

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:28.040
I now understand why Athena is headed there.

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:30.250
It's not fair.

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.290
Seiya?

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:34.600
That's so inconsiderate, Miss Saori.

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:39.020
Why did you go alone without waiting for us?

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:42.000
We are Athena's Saints.

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:44.040
So why?

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:47.650
Seiya.

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:50.270
What's this?

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:52.360
Athena's Cosmo.

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:56.230
Seiya.

00:09:58.350 --> 00:09:59.320
Miss Saori.

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:02.440
I apologize.

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:06.880
But I had no other choice.

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:08.750
Why?

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:18.610
It's all to prevent Hades' Greatest Eclipse.

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:22.070
Please understand, Seiya.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:25.520
Miss Saori!

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:27.840
Miss Saori!

00:10:32.210 --> 00:10:34.780
What is this Cosmo?

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:49.670
Valentine has been defeated.

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:54.110
The Gold Saints are still here.

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:56.330
Phoenix is still here.

00:10:56.780 --> 00:10:59.900
Then it must have been Pegasus.

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:04.400
Judging from the fact that he's not here.

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:06.260
But how?

00:11:06.570 --> 00:11:12.560
Other than us Specters, no one can
escape the Ice Hell by themselves.

00:11:13.030 --> 00:11:16.100
If someone somehow did,

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:19.750
he'd be as powerful as Lord Hades.

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:25.740
What is this Cosmo?

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:31.000
This deep Cosmo is coming from
the Giudecca. No, further away.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:31.790
Could it be...

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:33.740
Athena's Cosmo?

00:11:44.280 --> 00:11:49.510
Look. The Gold Saints are beginning to
move after receiving Athena's Cosmo.

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:51.620
What? Impossible!

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:03.330
The Gold Saints...

00:12:05.770 --> 00:12:07.170
The Gold Saints

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:09.120
have resurrected!

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:16.640
Don't panic, we have the
advantage in the Cocytus.

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:19.780
Athena's Saints are basically dead.

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:43.820
Scarlet Needle.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:52.330
Damn you!

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:55.390
Stardust Revolution!

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:04.970
With just one blow!

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:08.280
Where are you going?

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:11.710
I am your opponent.

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:15.010
Don't get ahead of yourself!

00:13:19.780 --> 00:13:22.450
Lightning Plasma!

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:31.880
Aioria.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:36.740
It seems that we were saved by Athena.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:41.920
I'm concerned about Seiya and the
others. Let's go to the Giudecca.

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:45.080
Wait, Aioria. What about the Phoenix?

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:49.510
What happened?

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:52.510
As expected, Phoenix.

00:13:57.410 --> 00:14:01.320
Beyond this wall is Athena. Miss Saori.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:05.530
Shun, take care of the Athena Cloth.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:08.220
Seiya, what do you plan to do?

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:11.680
Obviously, ignite my Cosmo to the fullest

00:14:11.810 --> 00:14:14.950
and smash into the Wailing Wall.

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:19.340
That's reckless, Seiya.

00:14:19.470 --> 00:14:23.890
Even Shaka wasn't able
to put a scratch on it.

00:14:23.890 --> 00:14:25.720
Do you plan to die?

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:27.400
Shun, have you forgotten?

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:32.270
When we passed Hell's Gate we
vowed never to give up hope.

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:33.600
Seiya.

00:14:34.090 --> 00:14:41.360
Even if the Wailing Wall only
brings despair to mortals,

00:14:42.550 --> 00:14:46.430
I will not give up until the end.

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:51.920
I will demolish this wall and
stop the Greatest Eclipse.

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:56.240
I'll stop the evil plans of Hades!

00:14:58.210 --> 00:14:59.760
Stand back, Shun!

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:01.320
Seiya!

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:07.750
Seiya, listen to Shun. Stop it.

00:15:08.850 --> 00:15:09.680
Shaka.

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:14.960
Even if you ignite your Cosmo to the
fullest and crash into the wall,

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:19.690
the Wailing Wall will not
budge. You'll just die.

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:23.400
You won't know until I try!

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:25.450
Get out of the way, Shaka!

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:32.120
Shaka.

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:33.340
Seiya.

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:41.300
It's useless. I just remembered
what I heard before.

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:45.860
To destroy the Wailing Wall,

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:48.820
you need sunlight.

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:51.580
Sunlight?

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:52.640
That's right.

00:15:52.990 --> 00:15:56.580
In a place full of darkness,
light represents hope.

00:15:56.920 --> 00:16:02.610
Light is the source of life
as long as we have sunlight.

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:05.840
But in the Underworld...

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:06.780
Yes.

00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:14.540
It's not possible for sunlight
to reach the depths of hell.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:16.880
It's absolutely impossible.

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:20.960
For mortals, even if you're
prepared to give up your life,

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:24.580
there is nothing we can do.

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.290
Shaka.

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:31.900
However, Athena is chasing
Hades to Elysion unarmed.

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:38.910
The world is minutes away from complete
darkness by the Greatest Eclipse.

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:45.030
As Seiya says, we may have to sacrifice
our lives even if we know it is futile.

00:16:46.220 --> 00:16:50.110
Shaka, did you stop Seiya so
you can die instead of him?

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:56.620
Athena.

00:16:58.630 --> 00:16:59.490
Shaka!

00:17:01.860 --> 00:17:05.630
Incredible. I feel an
awesome Cosmo from Shaka.

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:12.240
This is the Cosmo of a man closest to God.

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:19.070
He's burning his own life energy

00:17:19.570 --> 00:17:22.670
to create the same light as the sun.

00:17:26.070 --> 00:17:28.320
What is this Cosmo?

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:31.360
Shaka, what are you doing?

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:34.680
Shaka is taking your place.

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:35.620
No way.

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:37.330
Shaka!

00:17:45.450 --> 00:17:46.410
Shaka!

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:47.600
It's too much!

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:50.270
Stop it, Shaka!

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:55.930
My life shall burn away!

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:57.090
Shaka!

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:01.780
Stop it, Shaka.

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:09.770
You! You're Grand Master Libra Dohko.

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:15.000
Grand Master? Libra Dohko?

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:20.550
Shaka, a man like you should not have to die.

00:18:21.220 --> 00:18:22.710
However, Grand Master...

00:18:22.840 --> 00:18:25.670
Shaka, it's as the Grand Master says.

00:18:26.490 --> 00:18:29.040
It's too soon to die by yourself.

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:34.030
All of you!

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:38.630
Mu. Aioria. Miro.

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:47.140
The three who saved me with
their Cosmo are still alive!

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:51.180
It is all due to Athena.

00:18:51.660 --> 00:18:52.850
Athena?

00:18:53.470 --> 00:18:58.970
Yes, there's still work for us to do.

00:18:59.440 --> 00:19:06.690
Shaka, I am returning the 108 bead
rosary I was holding for you.

00:19:07.050 --> 00:19:08.060
Mu.

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:12.700
Look at the beads that have changed color.

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:17.720
You can die only after changing
the color of all the beads.

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:19.040
Mu.

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:28.810
But without sunlight, we
cannot pass the Wailing Wall.

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:33.620
We can't go after Athena
who is beyond this wall.

00:19:34.350 --> 00:19:35.970
Sunlight.

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:42.500
We have no time to waste as Hades has

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:48.290
begun the Greatest Eclipse.

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:52.390
So I must do what I can.

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:53.840
We can break it.

00:19:57.820 --> 00:19:59.930
We can break through the Wailing Wall.

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:01.680
The Wailing Wall?

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:02.380
You can break through it?

00:20:03.030 --> 00:20:04.120
Yes.

00:20:04.810 --> 00:20:11.520
By combining the powers of the Gold Saints,
it is possible to create sunlight.

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:14.480
By combining our powers...

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:17.320
And create sunlight?

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:22.150
Grand Master, what do you mean?

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:28.870
Have you forgotten where the
Gold Saint constellations shine?

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:35.340
Right, the Gold Saint constellations
are on the solar ecliptic.

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:39.810
The ecliptic is the path the
sun moves along in one year.

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:44.870
The twelve Gold Cloth constellations
are on the path of the sun.

00:20:45.350 --> 00:20:49.590
They have been absorbing the power
of the sun since ancient times.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:57.520
It means that for every Gold Cloth,
there is sunlight accumulated within it.

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:01.760
Right.

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:03.990
Which means, Grand Master...

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:05.590
That's right.

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:13.160
If we, with the power of the sun, ignite
our Cosmo and crash into the wall,

00:21:25.330 --> 00:21:28.880
we will definitely be able
to destroy the Wailing Wall!

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:37.170
For the first time...

00:21:37.340 --> 00:21:39.350
For the first time the Gold Saints

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:42.500
have taken hold of the Libra weapons!

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:46.240
We'll destroy the Wailing Wall!

00:21:46.540 --> 00:21:49.250
To defeat Hades!

00:21:49.350 --> 00:21:51.680
To protect Athena.

00:21:51.820 --> 00:21:54.930
To stop the Greatest Eclipse.

00:21:55.050 --> 00:21:59.080
And to protect peace on Earth.

00:22:03.390 --> 00:22:07.190
We shall become sunlight!

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:05.550
The Gold Saints face the Wailing Wall.

00:24:05.710 --> 00:24:07.710
When their Cosmo is burned to the limit,

00:24:08.010 --> 00:24:10.010
a blinding light appears.

00:24:10.300 --> 00:24:15.190
And Canon risks his life,
heading toward the final battle,

00:24:15.420 --> 00:24:17.940
as if he were trying to atone for his sins.

00:24:18.420 --> 00:24:21.560
Canon! We've accepted your feelings!

00:24:22.060 --> 00:24:25.420
Saint Seiya: "Reunion: The Gold Cloths."

00:24:25.730 --> 00:24:28.530
Have you ever felt your Cosmo?
